{% extends "quarterly_deep_dive/llm_prompts/base_prompt.j2" %}

{# Specific context for the second callout in Section 6 (EOP Deep Dive) #}
{% set output_format_description = "a brief callout (1-2 sentences) highlighting a second, distinct insight about EOP vulnerabilities from the Section 6 data/insights, suitable for a distinct callout box" %}

{% block task_instructions %}
Review the data summaries and chart insights provided below for "{{ section_title }}". This section focuses on EOP vulnerabilities.
Following the general instructions, identify a *second, distinct* significant finding related to EOPs (different from Callout 1). Perhaps focus on the less common attack vectors and their implications, or relate the proportion trend to the attack vector findings.
Craft a concise callout (1-2 sentences maximum) stating this key finding clearly.
{% endblock task_instructions %}

